    "body": "@annevk @rniwa @whatwg/html-parser  could use your input making a design decision on the above.\nI personally don't think inherited namespace on `<template>` is particularly useful and the other two ways to support templates in SVG/MathML are the important ones. But it's not an objection and the current PR handles inherited namespaces as well (with the mentioned complexity around stickiness). Also the inherited namespace thing can be added later if there is popular demand, the design doesn't prohibit that.",
