    "body": "I think if we store the inherited namespace (including \"`html`\") on the `template` element and force it when serializing (and remove any developer-set attribute of that name first) we are good.\n\nWe also have to account for it with fragment parsing.\n\nNot inheriting would give a bad experience for SVG and MathML.\n\nI'm not entirely convinced yet that `type` is the name we want here. I would prefer `contentnamespace`. And have the `contentNamespace` IDL attribute always return the qualified namespace (make it return the internal state, where we just use the actual namespace).",
